# cloud-ci-dto-authz-trust: live-corpus self-test over the real *Authorization-DTO use-case
# surfaces plus RED/GREEN fixtures. The live leg walks the candidate tree, asserts the gate is
# born-blocking green today (every pre-existing caller-supplied-authz-trust instance frozen in the
# baseline), and confirms the FIXED iam/ports/policy-cedar-api/src/authz.rs PDP-port pattern is
# recognized as GREEN. The RED fixture proves the gate genuinely FAILS on a NEW function that trusts
# a forged authorization DTO with no PDP call; the GREEN fixture proves a verify_principal +
# ensure_authorized PDP-port handler is tolerated.
